        "https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/configurations/setup-models/folded-sheet/cross-tri-fold",
        "https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/configurations/setup-models/folded-sheet/roll-fold"
      ],
      "scopeNote": {
        "en": "Thirteen Setup Models cover the full folded-sheet topology space, matching the corresponding Folding operations in printing/completions/finishing/folding/. Surface structure varies: 4 panels (single-fold), 6 panels (tri-fold, z-fold, gate-fold variants, tri-fold-stand), 8 panels (double-closed-gate-fold, double-parallel-fold, cross-fold, roll-fold), 12 panels (cross-tri-fold), and variable count (accordion-fold).",
        "pt": "Treze Modelos de Montagem cobrem todo o espaço topológico de folha dobrada, correspondendo às operações de Dobra em printing/completions/finishing/folding/. A estrutura de faces varia: 4 painéis (dobra simples), 6 painéis (tríptico, dobra Z, variantes de dobra janela, tríptico de mesa), 8 painéis (dobra janela fechada dupla, dobra paralela dupla, dobra cruzada, dobra envolvente), 12 painéis (tríptico cruzado) e número variável (sanfona).",
        "hi": "तेरह सेटअप मॉडल पूरे फ़ोल्डेड-शीट बनावट-दायरे को कवर करते हैं, printing/completions/finishing/folding/ की संगत फ़ोल्डिंग क्रियाओं से मेल खाते हुए। सतह संरचना भिन्न है: 4 पैनल (सिंगल-फ़ोल्ड), 6 पैनल (ट्राई-फ़ोल्ड, Z-फ़ोल्ड, गेट-फ़ोल्ड वेरिएंट, ट्राई-फ़ोल्ड स्टैंड), 8 पैनल (डबल-क्लोज़्ड-गेट-फ़ोल्ड, डबल-पैरलल-फ़ोल्ड, क्रॉस-फ़ोल्ड, रोल-फ़ोल्ड), 12 पैनल (क्रॉस-ट्राई-फ़ोल्ड) और परिवर्तनशील संख्या (अकॉर्डियन-फ़ोल्ड)।"
      },
